# drive.press with tools/port/mods_synth.py's fuzz/three mod: a file of every kind cut to three quarters.
# Each is refused, or (when the game reads none of what changed) used; the race runs either way, under the
# sanitizers too (docs/port/MODS.md 8).
# until: 0x400000:900
# seconds: 90
# expect: state=0x00400000: players 1, windows 1, cars 6, mode 0, track 0
# args: --mods-dir mods/fuzz/three --screenshot-at 1600 --screenshot mods_fuzz_three.png
# check: tools/port/synth_shot.py mods_fuzz_three.png 1
5 A            # the controller pak warning
8 START        # the start prompt
11 A           # the main menu: the race
14 A           # the player screen
17 A           # the mode screen: a single race
20 A           # the track select: track 0
23 A           # the car select; the race starts at about 23.6 s and its countdown runs 3.5 s
27 A 20        # gas for 20 s
32 STICKRIGHT 1.5
36 STICKLEFT 1.5
47 B 3         # the brake
